pan class=\"this\">This Product</span></strong><ul><li>Excels at multitasking</li><li>Power users and multimedia creation</li></ul></div></section>\n<section class=\"topic\" id=\"memory\"><h3>System Memory (RAM)</h3><p>Random-access memory (RAM) or simply “memory,” is what allows your computer to multitask. More RAM means more applications can be running simultaneously without slowdowns.</p><div class=\"level\"><img src=\"__PLACEHOLDER_ASSETS_BASE_DIR__/020.svg\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\" alt=\"\"><strong>Low</strong><ul><li>Great for basic tasks</li><li>Good for web browsing and streaming</li></ul></div><div class=\"level\"><img src=\"__PLACEHOLDER_ASSETS_BASE_DIR__/020.svg\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\" alt=\"\"><strong>Medium</strong><ul><li>Handles heavy applications</li><li>Great for advanced gaming</li></ul></div><div class=\"level product\"><img src=\"__PLACEHOLDER_ASSETS_BASE_DIR__/020.svg\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\" alt=\"\"><strong>High <span class=\"this\">This Product</span></strong><ul><li>Manages multiple heavy apps simultaneously</li><li>Great for professional A/V editing</li><li>Ideal for serious gaming</li></ul></div></section>\n<section class=\"topic\" id=\"graphics\"><h3>Graphics</h3><p>The GPU (graphics processing unit), or “graphics card,” is what displays images, animations and graphics on the computer’s screen. A more powerful GPU makes games run faster and look better.</p><div class=\"level\"><img src=\"__PLACEHOLDER_ASSETS_BASE_DIR__/021.svg\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\" alt=\"\"><strong>Entry-Level</strong><ul><li>Budget friendly</li><li>Basic gaming</li></ul></div><div class=\"level\"><img src=\"__PLACEHOLDER_ASSETS_BASE_DIR__/021.svg\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\" alt=\"\"><strong>Mid-Range</strong><ul><li>Most common GPU</li><li>Fast display</li><li>High performance gaming</li></ul></div><div class=\"level product\"><img src=\"__PLACEHOLDER_ASSETS_BASE_DIR__/021.svg\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\" alt=\"\"><strong>High-End <span class=\"this\">This Product</span></strong><ul><li>Offers gameplay at max settings</li><li>Powerful and efficient</li><li>Ideal for gaming enthusiasts</li></ul></div></section>\n<section class=\"topic\" id=\"storage-type\"><h3>Storage Type</h3><p>Storage type is one of the most important factors to consider as you decide which new computer to purchase. The right storage type for you will depend on your budget, the amount of storage space you'll need and the types of programs you'll use.</p><div class=\"level\"><img src=\"__PLACEHOLDER_ASSETS_BASE_DIR__/022.svg\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\" alt=\"\"><strong>HDD</strong><ul><li>Large file and content capacity</li><li>Costs less per gigabyte than SSD</li><li>Great for everyday use</li></ul></div><div class=\"level product\"><img src=\"__PLACEHOLDER_ASSETS_BASE_DIR__/022.svg\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\" alt=\"\"><strong>SSD <span class=\"this\">This Product</span></strong><ul><li>Some capacity for HD files</li><li>Apps and games run faster than with HDD</li><li>Optimal gaming performance</li></ul></div><div class=\"level\"><img src=\"__PLACEHOLDER_ASSETS_BASE_DIR__/023.svg\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\" alt=\"\"><strong>HDD+SSD</strong><ul><li>SSD speed + HDD capacity</li><li>Fast startup; generous storage</li><li>Optimal gaming performance</li></ul></div></section>\n<section class=\"topic\" id=\"capacity\"><h3>Total Storage Capacity</h3><p>Storage capacity determines how much data you can store on your computer. If you typically store small files (word documents and spreadsheets) and run basic programs, you can get by with a lower storage capacity. You'll want to consider higher storage capacity if you do a lot of photo or video editing, or if you use your computer for large gaming installs.</p><div class=\"level\"><img src=\"__PLACEHOLDER_ASSETS_BASE_DIR__/023.svg\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\" alt=\"\"><strong>Small</strong><ul><li>Great for working with small files</li><li>Runs basic programs</li><li>Add cloud storage for extra space</li></ul></div><div class=\"level\"><img src=\"__PLACEHOLDER_ASSETS_BASE_DIR__/023.svg\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\" alt=\"\"><strong>Medium</strong><ul><li>Great for most uses</li><li>Starting point for gaming or high-res video</li><li>Some photo/video editing</li></ul></div><div class=\"level product\"><img src=\"__PLACEHOLDER_ASSETS_BASE_DIR__/023.svg\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\" alt=\"\"><strong>Large <span class=\"this\">This Product</span></strong><ul><li>High resolution video</li><li>Higher cost gives more storage</li><li>Great for large game installs</li></ul></div></section>\n</div>\n</section>\n<script>\nconst drawer=document.getElementById('drawer'),shade=document.getElementById('shade'),content=document.getElementById('content');\nfunction openDrawer(topic){drawer.classList.add('open');shade.classList.add('open');document.querySelectorAll('.tabs button').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.jump===topic));setTimeout(()=>{const el=document.getElementById(topic);if(el)content.scrollTo({top:el.offsetTop-10,behavior:'smooth'})},20)}\nfunction closeDrawer(){drawer.classList.remove('open');shade.classList.remove('open')}\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.feature').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>openDrawer(b.dataset.topic)));\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.tabs button').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{document.querySelectorAll('.tabs button').forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('active'));b.classList.add('active');const el=document.getElementById(b.dataset.jump);content.scrollTo({top:el.offsetTop-10,behavior:'smooth'})}));\ndocument.getElementById('close').addEventListener('click',closeDrawer);shade.addEventListener('click',closeDrawer);\ncontent.addEventListener('scroll',()=>{let active='processor';document.querySelectorAll('.topic').forEach(s=>{if(s.offsetTop-content.scrollTop<130)active=s.id});document.querySelectorAll('.tabs button').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.jump===active))});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n```",
